# MoE-Infinity ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** CUDA runtime for MoE inference with expert offload to RAM/NVMe, activation-aware caching, prefetching and OpenAI-compatible serving.

**LEONES status:** active source; priority ODS candidate; LEONES benchmark pending.

## Executive summary

MoE-Infinity directly addresses the bottleneck motivating this research: MoE models whose experts cannot all fit in VRAM. It keeps active computation on the GPU while offloading experts to host memory and SSD, with activation-aware caching and prefetching.

The runtime also provides continuous serving, paged KV cache, SSE streaming, health monitoring and multi-GPU support.

## ODS fit

MoE-Infinity is currently one of the clearest candidates for the dedicated MoE branch of ODS. It can be exposed through a runtime adapter while ODS retains responsibility for hardware/model selection.

**Classification:** P1 specialized MoE runtime candidate.